{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05XF", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\cite{Gr-I}", "REF_0002": "\\cite{Gr-II}", "REF_0003": "\\cite{Gr-III}", "REF_0004": "\\cite{Gr-IV}", "REF_0005": "\\cite{Gr-V}", "REF_0006": "\\cite{Gr-VI}", "REF_0007": "\\cite{ArtinI}", "REF_0008": "\\cite{ArtinII}", "REF_0009": "\\cite{Artin-Theorem-Representability}", "REF_0010": "\\cite{Artin-Construction-Techniques}", "REF_0011": "\\cite{Artin-Algebraic-Spaces}", "REF_0012": "\\cite{Artin-Algebraic-Approximation}", "REF_0013": "\\cite{Artin-Implicit-Function}", "REF_0014": "\\cite{ArtinVersal}", "REF_0015": "\\ref{quot-section-conventions}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:16889cc882df0a03e8f160122699d84da5792d87952709da49c8229cb175ed7e", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe purpose of this chapter is to find criteria guaranteeing that a\nstack in groupoids over the category of schemes with the fppf topology\nis an algebraic stack. Historically, this often involved proving that\ncertain functors were representable, see Grothendieck's lectures\n<REF_0001>,\n<REF_0002>,\n<REF_0003>,\n<REF_0004>,\n<REF_0005>, and\n<REF_0006>.\nThis explains the title of this chapter. Another important source\nof this material comes from the work of Artin, see\n<REF_0007>,\n<REF_0008>,\n<REF_0009>,\n<REF_0010>,\n<REF_0011>,\n<REF_0012>,\n<REF_0013>, and\n<REF_0014>.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nSome of the notation, conventions and terminology in this chapter is awkward\nand may seem backwards to the more experienced reader. This is intentional.\nPlease see Quot, Section <REF_0015> for an\nexplanation.\n\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7a99a11e1efbea1aeb57f59844f7950925b1127b8f961b2d7af5cb538807a627", "unit_id": "tag:05XF:prose-0001"}
